.TH PARU-WRAPPER 1 "November 2026" "paru-wrapper 1.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
paru-wrapper \- Enhanced paru wrapper with local AUR repository management, modular plugin hooks, and VCS migrations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B paru-wrapper
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIPARU_ARGS\fR...]
.br
.B paru-wrapper
\fB\-\-init\-repo\fR \fIREPO_NAME\fR \fIREPO_DIR\fR \fIPROJECTS_DIR\fR
.br
.B paru-wrapper
\fB\-\-connect\-repo\fR \fIREPO_NAME\fR \fIREPO_DIR\fR \fIPROJECTS_DIR\fR
.br
.B paru-wrapper
\fB\-\-wrapper\-help\fR
.br
.B paru-wrapper
\fB\-\-wrapper\-version\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B paru-wrapper
is a wrapper around the \fBparu\fR AUR helper and \fBpacman\fR package manager on Arch Linux.
It automates local custom repository management, performs automated orphan pruning, accelerates batch queries, provides modular plugin hooks, supports interactive search-and-install with automatic repository synchronization, and supports migrating packages to bleeding-edge VCS \fB-git\fR variants via \fB\-\-gittinator\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-gittinator
Scans installed AUR packages and migrates them to development VCS (\-git) variants where available.
.TP
.B \-\-init\-repo \fIREPO_NAME\fR \fIREPO_DIR\fR \fIPROJECTS_DIR\fR
Initializes an empty custom local pacman repository database and writes the client configuration to \fI~/.config/paru-wrapper/paru-wrapper.conf\fR.
.TP
.B \-\-connect\-repo \fIREPO_NAME\fR \fIREPO_DIR\fR \fIPROJECTS_DIR\fR
Connects to an existing custom local pacman repository.
.TP
.B \-\-wrapper\-help
Displays the extended help message detailing wrapper-specific options, plugin hooks, and environment variables.
.TP
.B \-\-wrapper\-version
Displays the version of paru-wrapper.
.SH MODULAR PLUGINS
.B paru-wrapper
supports an event-driven plugin hook architecture. Plugins are shell scripts placed in:
.IP \(bu 2
\fI~/.config/paru-wrapper/plugins.d/\fR (user-specific overrides)
.IP \(bu 2
\fI/etc/paru-wrapper/plugins.d/\fR (system overrides)
.IP \(bu 2
\fI/usr/lib/paru-wrapper/plugins.d/\fR (packaged default plugins)
.PP
Plugins handle events: \fBpre-transaction\fR, \fBpost-transaction\fR, \fBpackage-rebuilt\fR, \fBdeferred-hooks\fR, and \fBpost-transaction-bg\fR.
.PP
Default plugins include:
.TP
.B 10-snapper.sh
Pre/post transaction Btrfs snapshots (requires \fBsnapper\fR).
.TP
.B 20-anneal.sh
Automatically unmarks packages from the rebuild queue upon recompilation (requires \fBanneal\fR).
.TP
.B 25-projects-pull.sh
Fetches fast-forward updates for clean git repositories residing in \fIPARU_WRAPPER_PROJECTS_DIR\fR and rebuilds/installs updated packages that are already installed.
.TP
.B 30-rebuild-check.sh
Analyzes installed packages for broken shared library bindings after system updates (requires \fBrebuild-check-hook\fR).
.TP
.B 40-paru-completion.sh
Regenerates shell tab completion cache files (requires \fBparu-completion-hook\fR).
.TP
.B 50-vault-sync.sh
Background configuration vault synchronization.
.SH ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
.TP
.B PARU_WRAPPER_AUTO_UPDATE_INSTALLED
When enabled (default), automatically upgrades local custom repository packages when a newer version is discovered in the AUR, and rebuilds/installs updated installed projects in \fIPARU_WRAPPER_PROJECTS_DIR\fR.
.TP
.B PARU_WRAPPER_REPO
Custom local repository name.
.TP
.B PARU_WRAPPER_PROJECTS_DIR
Path to local development project checkouts (default: \fI~/Projects\fR).
.TP
.B FORCE_REBUILD
When set to 1, forces recompilation of target packages from source.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR paru (8),
.BR pacman (8),
.BR makepkg (8)
